State 0

    0 $accept: . S $end
    1 S: . G C
    6 G: %empty .  ['e', 'a', 'b']

    'e'  reduce using rule 6 (G)
    'a'  reduce using rule 6 (G)
    'b'  reduce using rule 6 (G)

    S  go to state 1
    G  go to state 2


State 1

